{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Dash</strong> is a fast-paced, click-to-dash action game where every move is an explosion. Dash across the battlefield, collide with swarms of rock-like enemies, and unleash devastating area damage. Each rock shattered rewards you with gold, which fuels a massive skill tree that lets you grow stronger, deadlier, and more creative with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032890/extras/ab3b413fd43b523e4b99426cfd8a9150.poster.avif?t=1758815507\" width=800 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032890/extras/ab3b413fd43b523e4b99426cfd8a9150.webm?t=1758815507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032890/extras/ab3b413fd43b523e4b99426cfd8a9150.mp4?t=1758815507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The free demo gives you a taste of Space Dash\u2019s explosive gameplay with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Levels</strong> to blast through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity Pull Mechanic</strong> to test your crowd-control skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turrets</strong> you can deploy for extra firepower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Spaceship</strong> to customize your playstyle</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explosive Dash Combat</strong> \u2013 Click anywhere to instantly dash and create a destructive shockwave, damaging every enemy caught in the blast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rock Enemies &amp; Bosses</strong> \u2013 Face off against waves of stone-like foes and massive boss rocks with unique challenges and higher gold multipliers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity Pull Mechanic</strong> \u2013 Activate a powerful ability that drags enemies into a cluster, setting up perfect dashes for maximum carnage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turrets &amp; Missile Strikes</strong> \u2013 Deploy helpful turrets and unlock dash-triggered missile barrages that rain destruction across the arena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Skill Tree Progression</strong> \u2013 Spend gold to unlock hundreds of upgrades: boost dash damage, expand explosion radius, increase enemy density for bigger rewards, improve missile chance and turret power, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Runs</strong> \u2013 Quick, action-packed sessions that keep you coming back for \u201cjust one more upgrade.\u201d</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Level_2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4032890/1229dde47a63d86880f443ef05a804a47e4c087b.jpg"},{"name":"Level_1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4032890/cd8de887780a436a6474b7d5dfcc8393948de2c9.jpg"},{"name":"Level_3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4032890/c2e5ea7fd9b866d6eddcb785ae016fd4333b0b18.jpg"},{"name":"Level_4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4032890/188dc03bf523ac3fc8f26a142ebae6f9b4be2ae9.jpg"},{"name":"Speed Demon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4032890/f43baaa206d8380ac1fbbc67bb2bf551b7ad946a.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4032890?t=1758815507","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4032890?t=175