paragraph\" ><strong>Turrets</strong> you can deploy for extra firepower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Spaceship</strong> to customize your playstyle</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explosive Dash Combat</strong> \u2013 Click anywhere to instantly dash and create a destructive shockwave, damaging every enemy caught in the blast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rock Enemies &amp; Bosses</strong> \u2013 Face off against waves of stone-like foes and massive boss rocks with unique challenges and higher gold multipliers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity Pull Mechanic</strong> \u2013 Activate a powerful ability that drags enemies into a cluster, setting up perfect dashes for maximum carnage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turrets &amp; Missile Strikes</strong> \u2013 Deploy helpful turrets and unlock dash-triggered missile barrages that rain destruction across the arena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Skill Tree Progression</strong> \u2013 Spend gold to unlock hundreds of upgrades: boost dash damage, expand explosion radius, increase enemy density for bigger rewards, improve missile chance and turret power, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Runs</strong> \u2013 Quick, action-packed sessions that keep you coming back for \u201cjust one more upgrade.\u201d</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Almirad"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3991360","name":"Space Dash"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032890/a26060c398820d58b5786691ec03e74e02b82f48/header.jpg?t=1758815507","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"